Introduction
Every day, billions of people type website addresses like:
•	google.com
•	youtube.com
•	amazon.com
Most people think pressing Enter instantly loads a webpage.
In reality, dozens of networking processes occur in less than a second.
Understanding this journey is one of the most important skills in networking and cybersecurity.
Whenever a website doesn't load, a network engineer mentally follows this exact journey to determine where the problem occurred.
________________________________________
Scenario
Suppose you type:
https://www.google.com
